    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "9ef77f50-f9a3-4863-9a8d-b3eab1386065",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Farting at the Hairdresser",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COASTALTOWN",
        "PublicId": "103707142488",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository a77e1d9f-424f-478e-a00d-1bdac10b0f6d).Image",
        "Description": "Our client had her hair cut way too short than she asked for at a Sapienza Hairdresser and she feels a negative review won&apos;t justify their crimes. Find a way to eliminate the hairdresser himself, and at least two patients who want a haircut. Our client wants you to do it Silent Assassin Suit Only. This may be a tough one 47. Might I suggest brining two things of injected lethal poson and a briefcase that farts?",
